flowchart TD
    PersonCSV[person table CSV] --> Preserve[Keep original headers and values]
    PersonCSV --> RowKey[Choose internal person_key]
    Preserve --> HeaderResolve[Resolve headers using table-column rules]
    HeaderResolve --> CellRegex[Run loaded regex rules against labelled cells]
    Preserve --> EmailExtract[Extract email-looking values from any cell]
    HeaderResolve --> CompositeName[Combine first + last name columns]
    CellRegex --> Anchors[Build known-person anchors]
    EmailExtract --> Anchors
    CompositeName --> Anchors
